  "description": "This value set is a 'starter set' of LOINC panel and panel item codes for the USCDI Nutrition Assessment data element. It is the set of panel items of the LOINC Nutrition assessment panel (75282-4), which LOINC created for the Nutrition Section of the HL7 Implementation Guide for CDA Release 2: Consolidated CDA Templates for Clinical Notes. The codes are used in the US Core Observation Screening Assessment Profile and the SDC Base Questionnaire/US Core QuestionnaireResponse Profile to record the questions and responses of a structured nutrition assessment.",
